{"id": 951, "title": "Watch Movie", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "watch-movie", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/951_watch-movie.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["听说有个新电影，我没看过，但是他们说很有意思。我想和我的女朋友去看，但是我的朋友们也想去。虽然我的朋友们不认识我的女朋友，但是我想让他们见面认识认识。我们就可以一起去看电影了。我们想明天去商场的那个电影院，我去过一次，那儿还可以，就是不便宜。明天见！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["聽說有個新電影，我沒看過，但是他們說很有意思。我想和我的女朋友去看，但是我的朋友們也想去。雖然我的朋友們不認識我的女朋友，但是我想讓他們見面認識認識。我們就可以一起去看電影了。我們想明天去商場的那個電影院，我去過一次，那兒還可以，就是不便宜。明天見！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["tīng shuō yǒu gè xīn diàn yǐng， wǒ méi kàn guo， dàn shì tā men shuō hěn yǒu yì si。 wǒ xiǎng hé wǒ de nǚ péng you qù kàn， dàn shì wǒ de péng you men yě xiǎng qù。 suī rán wǒ de péng you men bù rèn shi wǒ de nǚ péng you， dàn shì wǒ xiǎng ràng tā men jiàn miàn rèn shi rèn shi。 wǒ men jiù kě yǐ yī qǐ qù kàn diàn yǐng le。 wǒ men xiǎng míng tiān qù shāng chǎng de nà gè diàn yǐng yuàn， wǒ qù guo yī cì， nà r hái kě yǐ， jiù shì bù pián yi。 míng tiān jiàn！"], "english_paragraphs": ["I heard there’s a new movie out. I haven’t seen it, but people say it’s really interesting. I want to see it with my girlfriend, but my friends want to go too. My friends haven’t met my girlfriend, so I’d like to introduce them. Then we can all go to the movies together. We’re thinking of going to the movie theater at the mall tomorrow. I’ve been there once before. It’s okay, but it isn’t cheap. See you tomorrow!"], "english_full": "I heard there’s a new movie out. I haven’t seen it, but people say it’s really interesting. I want to see it with my girlfriend, but my friends want to go too. My friends haven’t met my girlfriend, so I’d like to introduce them. Then we can all go to the movies together. We’re thinking of going to the movie theater at the mall tomorrow. I’ve been there once before. It’s okay, but it isn’t cheap. See you tomorrow!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tīng shuō\" data-defn=\"to hear (sth said) / one hears (that)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">听说</span><span cl